2149	\subsection{Componentwise quantitative bounds}
2150	
2151	The following statements are formalization-only estimates supporting the
2152	quantitative extraction argument.  They are not separately named results of
2153	the source article.  In this subsection every complete or prescribed Pauli
2154	operator-family distance is a sum of squared state norms over
2155	$h\in\F_q^M$; the state distance itself is left unsquared unless a square is
2156	displayed.
